The '''Secretariat of Climate and the Environment'''  ({{lang-bl|Secretaría de Cambio Climatico y Medio Ambient}}) is the [[Secretariat Council (Balisca)|secretariat]] responsible for {{W|environmental issues}}, including influencing environmental policies and impacts on other confederal agencies. Since 1 December 2021, the incumbent Secretary has been [[Alessandro Massagué]]. 

Subordinate agencies include the [[Directorate for Cultural Heritage]], the [[Antarctic Institute]], the Environment Agency and the [[Baliscan Mapping Authority|Mapping Authority]], and the Secretariat oversees the implementation of the [[Green Protocol]] and the [[Casajuan Plan]]. {{Politics of Balisca}}

